uate this integral using the substitution $u=1+16x.$ Then, $\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{16}\\text{d}u.$\n\nWe also need to compute new limits:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & 0 & 3 \\\\ u & 1 & 49\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{1}^{49}\\sqrt{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{16}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{16}{\\int }_{1}^{49}\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{16}{[\\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3/2}]|}_{1}^{49} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{24}({49}^{3/2}-{1}^{3/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{343-1}{24} \\\\  & =\\frac{57}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384400 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384401 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384402 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384403 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384404 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1041 "selection" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1104 #edb/ref 17592186384403 13194139536117 true] [17592186384399 1110 #uuid "e7926d01-104d-5fcb-94ee-6efd88d03b45" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384400 1034 "\\frac{343}{24}" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384400 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536117 true] [17592186384400 1111 #uuid "3c96caac-0266-5fb5-9089-3708269cad91" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384401 1034 "\\frac{57}{8}" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384401 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536117 true] [17592186384401 1111 #uuid "06aea639-0d69-5dd2-91c0-20f0d0bab617" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384402 1034 "\\frac{13}{12}" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384402 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536117 true] [17592186384402 1111 #uuid "ec7e5507-7766-5f22-bfe4-a480513d105a" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384403 1034 "\\frac{57}{4}" 13194139536117 true] [17592186384403 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536117 true] [17592186384403 1111 #uuid "4ceff9f8-70f8-584b-a1ce-f8e2281bce83" 131